#: ../../source/docs/modules/map.rst:3 5cad35bf741f438599fe80b47bca5e3e
msgid "Moving Map"
msgstr "移动地图"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/map.rst:9 4b86cadbd28e4a60a03f294ae1cf65be
msgid ""
"A moving map display that shows the UAV's current position, waypoints and "
"geofence."
msgstr "动态地图，显示无人机当前位置、航点和地理围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/map.rst:12 afae77c8700643998e57ca73678df4b1
msgid ""
"Maps are automatically downloaded and cached to the user's hard drive. The "
"module will use these files if an internet connection is not found."
msgstr "地图自动下载并缓存至用户硬盘。无网络连接时，模块将使用已缓存的文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/map.rst:15 588e70e3d5934581917cc9e939d090df
msgid ""
"To display the waypoints and geofence, the ``wp list`` and ``fence list`` "
"commands can be used."
msgstr "使用 ``wp list`` 和 ``fence list`` 命令可显示航点和地理围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/map.rst:18 a9b9fc9a04de4fad80a6794d90ff6162
msgid ""
"Waypoint editing is allowing by right-clicking to select waypoint and then "
"right clicking to move it to that point."
msgstr "右键点击选择航点，再次右键点击可将其移动至该位置，从而编辑航点。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/map.rst:21 948fa6deebd1420295d847b9bf82000a
msgid ""
"To draw a set of waypoints, use the ``wp draw`` command. Right click on the "
"map for the desired waypoints. When finished, use the ``wp loop`` to connect"
" the last waypoint to the first one, creating a loop."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``wp draw`` 命令绘制一组航点。在地图上右键点击选定航点。完成后使用 ``wp loop`` 将最后一个航点连接到第一个，形成闭合航线。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/map.rst:25 fdf82ec93ed9480ebc0276f6fd8e12d7
msgid "Use the \"g\" key to specify a position to move the map to."
msgstr "按 「g」 键可指定地图跳转目标位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/map.rst:31 1068382ce7364882995607a2dec94688
msgid "The map has the following settings, which via be set via ``map set``."
msgstr "地图具有以下设置，可通过 ``map set`` 进行设置。"

